{
   "$comment": "Golden set. expect.tools excludes generalChat ([] = no tools): every listed tool must run at least as often as listed; repeats are fine; allow_extra = other tools that may also run without failing; ordered: true also requires that order (none set: no case depends on order). answer_contains: every item required, an inner array is any-of. Matching is case-insensitive with thousands separators removed. derived: expected number computed from the trace's getExchangeRate rate and KB prices (products = data/products file stems).",
